PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/branding
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

{
  "logoUrl": "https://example.com/logo.png",
  "themeColors": {"primary": "#000000"},
  "socialLinks": {},
  "welcomeMessage": "Test"
}

### 3.5.11 Update Branding With Invalid Token - Expect 401 Unauthorized
